OL,3,GNEWSASchoolboy imposter subjected
OL,4,Aex-professor and wife to 'terrifying
OL,5,Aordeal'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn imposter who made headlines around
OL,8,Fthe world for posing as a school pupil
OL,9,Fin his 30s has appeared in court and
OL,10,Fadmitted hiding in the home of his
OL,11,Fformer university professor before
OL,12,Fsubjecting him to a "terrifying ordeal"
OL,14,FBrian MacKinnon targeted Prof Brian
OL,15,FWhiting, 87, as he lay in bed with his
OL,16,Fwife, the day after a BBC docudrama on
OL,17,Fhis ruse was broadcast.
OL,19,FMy Old School chronicled MacKinnon's
OL,20,Freturn to Bearsden Academy, as Brandon
OL,21,FLee, a 16-year-old who had supposedly
OL,22,Fjust moved to Scotland from Canada.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
