OL,3,GNEWSASchoolboy imposter subjected
OL,4,Aex-professor and wife to 'terrifying
OL,5,Aordeal'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMacKinnon hatched the plan so he could
OL,8,Fpursue his dream of becoming a doctor
OL,9,Fhaving been thrown out of Glasgow
OL,10,FUniversity, when Prof Whiting was dean
OL,11,Fof the medical school.
